# Bundled skills ship as source only. Some skills (gstack, browse) build a
# single-file executable per platform; those are ~58 MB each and are native to
# the machine that built them, so they are useless to anyone else who clones
# this repo and would bloat it by an order of magnitude. Rebuild them locally —
# see skills/README.md.
skills/*/dist/
skills/*/*/dist/
skills/*/bin/gstack-global-discover
skills/**/node_modules/
skills/**/__pycache__/
skills/**/*.pyc
